---

<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <h1 class="headline">
      "If you're the smartest model<br />in the room,<br />
      <span class="highlight">you're in the wrong room."</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="subhead">
      Parliament gives AI agents the one thing bigger models can't buy — 
      <strong>diverse perspectives</strong>. Structured disagreement that catches blind 
      spots, surfaces tradeoffs, and makes your systems think before they act.
    </p>
    <div class="cta-group">
      <a href="#demo" class="btn btn-primary">See it in action</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/heybeaux/parliament" class="btn btn-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        View on GitHub
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="split-screen">
    <div class="panel single-model">
      <div class="panel-label">
        <span class="dot red"></span>
        Single Model
      </div>
      <div class="panel-content">
        <p class="answer">Based on the requirements, adopting a four-day work week would improve employee satisfaction and reduce overhead costs. The data shows a 20% productivity increase in pilot programs. Recommended for immediate implementation.</p>
        <div class="confidence-badge">Confidence: 94%</div>
        <div class="blindspot">⚠ Blind spot: ignores coordination costs, client expectations, and industry-specific constraints</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel parliament">
      <div class="panel-label">
        <span class="dot green"></span>
        Parliament
      </div>
      <div class="panel-content">
        <div class="turn proposer">
          <strong>Proposer:</strong> Four-day week boosts morale, cuts costs by 20%, and pilot data shows productivity gains...
        </div>
        <div class="turn skeptic">
          <strong>Skeptic:</strong> But the pilots excluded client-facing teams. What about coverage gaps and SLA breaches?
        </div>
        <div class="turn empiricist">
          <strong>Empiricist:</strong> Of 12 studies, 8 measured satisfaction — only 3 measured actual output. Evidence is mixed.
        </div>
        <div class="turn pragmatist">
          <strong>Pragmatist:</strong> Start with a 3-month pilot in non-client teams. Measure output, not hours.
        </div>
        <div class="turn synthesis">
          <strong>Synthesis:</strong> Conditional yes — pilot with specific teams, measure outcomes, expand based on data.
          <span class="residue">Residue: 0.3 · Consensus reached</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="tagline">
    <p class="tagline-text">Better reasoning, not better models.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 6rem 2rem 4rem;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 600px;
    height: 600px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--accent-glow) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: -1;
  }

  .headline {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .highlight {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-shadow: 0 0 40px var(--accent-glow);
  }

  .subhead {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.25rem);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 640px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .subhead strong {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .cta-group {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .btn {
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: white;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 0 24px var(--accent-glow);
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .split-screen {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 900px;
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .split-screen {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .panel {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .panel-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .dot.red { background: var(--red); }
  .dot.green { background: var(--green); box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.5); }

  .panel-content {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .single-model .answer {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .confidence-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15);
    color: var(--red);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .blindspot {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.5rem;
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1);
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--amber);
  }

  .parliament .turn {
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .parliament .turn:last-of-type {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .parliament .turn strong {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .parliament .turn.proposer strong { color: #60a5fa; }
  .parliament .turn.skeptic strong { color: #f87171; }
  .parliament .turn.empiricist strong { color: #a78bfa; }
  .parliament .turn.pragmatist strong { color: #34d399; }

  .residue {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.15);
    color: var(--green);
    padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    margin-left: 0.25rem;
  }

  .tagline {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .tagline-text {
    opacity: 0.6;
  }
</style>
